senses.gloss:
अग्रिम, अस्, आ, अम्, foremost; prior, preceding;
elder, eldest; principal, best; furthest advanced, first
ripe; further; (आ), f. a fruit, Annona Reticulata.

अग्र्य, अस्, आ, अम्, foremost, topmost, principal,
best, proficient; pointed, i. e. intent, closely attentive;
(अस्), m. an elder or eldest brother; (अम्), n. a roof.

आ-ग्रह, अस्, m. seizing, taking; attack; surpass-
ing, surmounting; favour; patronage; power, ability;
moral power, courage.

आग्रहायणिक, अस्, m. the month Agra-hāyaṇa;
(अस्, ई, अम्), to be paid on the day of full moon in
the month Agra-hāyaṇa.
